    "scenesThatPass": [
      "JESSIE: Y’might be staying in a luxury hotel Bella. Y’know three star and that, maybe more..\nBELLA: I don’t want to be staying in a bloody luxury hotel!",
      "BELLA: Well?? How is the girl?\nGLORIA: Hey Bella.. Hey Pops...\nBELLA: Gloria luv.. how are you?\nGLORIA: I’m OK.. Or I will be.",
      "BELLA: Of course she can.\nGLORIA: It won’t be for long Bella, I promise.\nBELLA: Stay as long as you want my luv. We’ve really missed you.",
      "BELLA: Health food shop? Round ‘ere? I think there’s one opposite the bookies on Menlove Avenue.\nGLORIA: Maybe you should get something for yourself baby, you look wiped. You OK?",
      "EILEEN: Another one just in-case Eileen gets them to stay still and snaps another.. Gloria takes the camera - she frames-up.\nGLORIA: Cheeeeeze!!"
    ]
